# Sign in as the workspace deployment operator or a linked workspace owner/admin.
# All authorized panel admins can inspect and manage full workspace workflows,
# including deployment operators without a personal Telegram link.
# Workflow runs use team per-run/monthly budgets; proposals omit budgetUsd.
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@workspaceId = REPLACE_WITH_WORKSPACE_UUID
@workflowId = REPLACE_WITH_WORKFLOW_UUID
@session = REPLACE_WITH_SESSION
@csrf = REPLACE_WITH_CSRF
@approvalId = REPLACE_WITH_APPROVAL_UUID

### List full workflows (100 per page) with current repository choices.
GET {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/workflows?offset=0
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}

### Fetch one workflow: { mode, workflow, repositorySources }.
# Both modes include the spec and saved versions. Missing/deleted records return
# 404; foreign workspaces remain denied.
# `next` contains recurrence previews, including when the workflow is not active.
GET {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/workflows/{{workflowId}}
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}

### Approve an exact workflow proposal as a panel admin, across workflow owners.
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/approvals/{{approvalId}}
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approve": true }

### Control a workflow; pause/resume/delete/run retain its execution owner.
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/workflows/{{workflowId}}/action
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": 1, "action": "pause" }

### Open details; workspace and list offset survive refresh and the back link.
GET {{origin}}/admin/workflows/{{workflowId}}?workspace={{workspaceId}}&offset=0
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
